JHHXPE3MP82R7AG4DWS4TB7C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの素敵なお花ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紗理菜💐"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-26625":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月31日発売の『TVstation』さんにザンビTEAM REDから山下美月さん、土生瑞穂さん、私で載せていただいています\\( ¨̮ )/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGT9SH6Z543YHTW6JJDWDQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3グループ初共演の撮影と取材でした！！😳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はソロかひらがなのメンバーとしかほぼ撮らないのですが隣に乃木坂さんと漢字さんがいるという事態になかなか現実味がありませんでした！😳✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても新鮮で楽しかったです☺️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGTAYDN4G95907BNF8JXW3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれの役どころなどもお話させていただきました♪👧🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして初めて着たザンビの衣装、ザンビプロジェクトの予告映像で乃木坂46の皆さんが着ていらっしゃった衣装を私も着ることができてすごく嬉しかったしとても光栄でした！！😭✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんぜひチェックしてくださいね😌💕"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGTBY8A0P4EXWXKYR84TCH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメン大好き齊藤京子"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-35819":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/d71/f654066814d9844e462fa678f5251.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニゾンエアーの衣装👗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエと少年の